{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["Take the staff — from before the testimony." "And you shall speak to the rock — the Holy One, blessed be He, did not command to take the staff in order to strike the rock with it, as He did at Refidim, where it is written: והכית בצור ויצאו ממנו מים. Rather, He commanded to take the staff to show by it the stubbornness of their rebellion, as it is written: למשמרת לאות לבני מרי. But by speech shall he speak to the rock to yield its waters." "And you shall bring forth water for them — by means of your speech to the rock."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:50:35.665535172Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}